      "writtenOn": "2024-11-19T04:41:35Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "The behavior of `setIncludeTestInterfaces` can be different from original `setEthernetEnabled`, and it does not bring up the iface again when calling `setIncludeTestInterfaces(true)`, and does not send out callback when calling `setIncludeTestInterfaces(false)`? How do we want to test it?",
      "parentUuid": "5fb3cb92_0f14ef4c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 604,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 604,
