      "lineNbr": 604,
      "author": {
        "id": 1962260
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-20T02:20:31Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "yes it calls `trackAvailableInterfaces()` but it does not reaches the code path of sending out broadcast, since when `setIncludeTestInterfaces(false)`, `maybeTrackInterface()` returns immediately on `!isValidEthernetInterface(iface)` because it is not a valid test iface any more because `mIncludeTestInterfaces` is already set to false.\nThen when calling `setIncludeTestInterfaces(true)` after this, since the iface is not removed from mFactory, so it is already tracked, no cb is triggered.",
      "parentUuid": "d7ac091a_74b8d54b",
